- [ ] Calendar and reminder alerts buzz twice, once from the iPhone and once from the band's copy #reminders #calendar #worth(later) #where(My Band/BLE/CalendarSyncService.swift:49) #added(2026-09-26)
	> @anchor: func pushAll() async {
	> The band gets its own copy of every calendar event and reminder and fires it itself,
	> while the iPhone's notification is also forwarded to the band, so each alert can buzz
	> twice. No setting stops the calendar/reminder push. Undecided: whether the band's own
	> copy is wanted is a preference, not a defect.
